### E — Entity-view verdict

**Environmental fixture absence, not a capability-registration failure and not a real entity-view regression.**

Evidence before guarding:

```text
DEBUG capability not invoked; rendered=<div class="ikb-entity-error ...
capability authorization registry version lookup failed:
Tenant database configuration could not be resolved for tenant 101
```

The test itself successfully registers the dynamic capability. Rendering fails earlier while resolving authorization state for nonexistent tenant fixture `101`. Therefore it now loudly skips through `requireTenantFixture(101)`.

